        <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Opposes\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/jedi-order\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Jedi Order\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Jedi and Sith are ancient enemies.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Led By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Led By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/sith/emperor-palpatine\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Emperor Palpatine\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Palpatine is the reigning Sith Master.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Has Member</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Has Member\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/galactic-empire/darth-vader\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Darth Vader\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Vader is a Sith Lord.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Uses</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Uses\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/the-force\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            The Force\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Sith wield the dark side of the Force.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Used By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Used By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/star-wars/lightsaber\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Lightsaber\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Sith wield lightsabers as well.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Jedi and Sith are ancient enemies.</li><li>Palpatine is the reigning Sith Master.</li><li>Vader is a Sith Lord.</li><li>Sith wield the dark side of the Force.</li><li>Evidence around Sith is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li><li>Sith currently maps to 60 linked entities inside Star Wars.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sources\">\n    <h2>Sources &amp; further reading</h2>\n    <p><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Sith\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Fandom wiki</a></p>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Sith?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        The Sith, also referred to as the Sith Order, was an ancient religious order of Force-wielders devoted to the dark side of the Force. Driven by their raw emotions, including hate, anger, and greed, the Sith were deceptive and obsessed with gaining power no matter the cost. The order had many forms until it reached the apex of its power under Darth Sidious, the Dark Lord of the Sith who achieved his order&#039;s goal of galactic conquest after a millennium of plotting. Within a generation, however, the deaths of Darth Sidious and <a href=\"/star-wars/galactic-empire/darth-vader\" class=\"entity-link\">Darth Vader</a> marked the end of the Sith Lords. Though the Sith ultimately went extinct with Sidious&#039;s demise, they still had a powerful legacy, and many continued to follow their teachings. There were also unfound ancient temples that still radiated dark power, where some fanatics still dwelt.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        Thousands of years before the Clone Wars, the <a href=\"/star-wars/jedi-order\" class=\"entity-link\">Jedi Order</a> was fractured by a schism that began when a rogue Jedi and his followers turned away from the light side of the Force, believing the dark side was the path to true power. Having relocated to the planet Korriban in the Outer Rim Territories, their movement ultimately evolved into the Sith Order, resulting in a war between the former brothers and sisters in the Force as the Jedi Knights rallied to the defense of the Old Republic. Although the Sith were driven off of the Core World Coruscant by 5000 BBY, centuries of conflict ensued between the two orders, culminating in the Old Republic&#039;s collapse. Undermined by constant infighting and ruined by the last war against the Jedi, the Sith were rendered all but extinct with the exception of one; Darth Bane survived the ancient order&#039;s destruction and passed his knowledge to a single apprentice, Darth Zannah, before being entombed on Korriban, which became known as Moraband. Henceforth, the Sith was governed by the Rule of Two, a new philosophy dictating that only two Sith Lords&amp;mdash;a Sith Master and a Sith apprentice&amp;mdash;could exist at any given time. As a result, the Sith were all but forgotten while the Jedi focused their efforts on preserving the new age of peace under the modern Galactic Republic.\n    </p>\n    \n</section>","word_count":1076,"uniqueness_score":"1.0000"},"entity":{"id":"37655360-6578-4d86-b4cc-8b6f8c2193bc","name":"Sith","slug":"sith","type":"organization","kind":"faction","type_label":"Faction","short_description":"The Sith, also referred to as the Sith Order, was an ancient religious order of Force-wielders devoted to the dark side of the Force. Driven by their raw emotions, including hate, anger, and greed, the Sith were…","description":"The Sith, also referred to as the Sith Order, was an ancient religious order of Force-wielders devoted to the dark side of the Force. Driven by their raw emotions, including hate, anger, and greed, the Sith were deceptive and obsessed with gaining power no matter the cost. The order had many forms until it reached the apex of its power under Darth Sidious, the Dark Lord of the Sith who achieved his order's goal of galactic conquest after a millennium of plotting. Within a generation, however, the deaths of Darth Sidious and Darth Vader marked the end of the Sith Lords. Though the Sith ultimately went extinct with Sidious's demise, they still had a powerful legacy, and many continued to follow their teachings. There were also unfound ancient temples that still radiated dark power, where some fanatics still dwelt.\n\nThousands of years before the Clone Wars, the Jedi Order was fractured by a schism that began when a rogue Jedi and his followers turned away from the light side of the Force, believing the dark side was the path to true power. Having relocated to the planet Korriban in the Outer Rim Territories, their movement ultimately evolved into the Sith Order, resulting in a war between the former brothers and sisters in the Force as the Jedi Knights rallied to the defense of the Old Republic. Although the Sith were driven off of the Core World Coruscant by 5000 BBY, centuries of conflict ensued between the two orders, culminating in the Old Republic's collapse. Undermined by constant infighting and ruined by the last war against the Jedi, the Sith were rendered all but extinct with the exception of one; Darth Bane survived the ancient order's destruction and passed his knowledge to a single apprentice, Darth Zannah, before being entombed on Korriban, which became known as Moraband. Henceforth, the Sith was governed by the Rule of Two, a new philosophy dictating that only two Sith Lords&mdash;a Sith Master and a Sith apprentice&mdash;could exist at any given time. As a result, the Sith were all but forgotten while the Jedi focused their efforts on preserving the new age of peace under the modern Galactic Republic.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"star-wars","aliases":[],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/b/bf/Sith_canon.svg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/360?cb=20160702013109","image_source":"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Sith","image_credit":"Fair-use identification thumbnail via Wookieepedia (Star Wars Fandom). Character / franchise art © Lucasfilm Ltd. / Disney (as applicable). Not free or redistributable artwork.","image_license":"fair_use","image_usage":"fair_use_identification","image_alt":"Identification thumbnail for Sith"},"connections":[],"rabbit_holes":[],"copyright":{"theme":"star-wars","title":"STAR WARS is not owned by Ton-o-Lore.","body":"STAR WARS and all rel